Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.56,0:01:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃大雄是也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.07,0:01:17.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.02,0:01:21.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃從石頭裏蹦出來的石猴 孫悟空是也
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.50,0:01:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗雲,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.05,0:01:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以用筋斗雲飛十萬八千里
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.96,0:01:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還可以使用七十二變
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.60,0:01:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無論是什麼樣的壞人都能把他們打的七零八落
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.75,0:01:38.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,實在是太厲害了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壞人出現了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.41,0:01:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.98,0:01:45.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大壞蛋,看你們往哪跑!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.51,0:01:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我們記住
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.83,0:01:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,膽小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.50,0:02:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.25,0:02:04.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.87,0:02:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.48,0:02:12.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.87,0:02:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.41,0:02:17.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是什麼哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是住在西方極樂世界的釋迦牟尼佛祖
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:22.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,釋迦牟尼佛祖?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.36,0:02:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你找我要做什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.06,0:02:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的口氣真是狂妄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是當然囉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.13,0:02:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然我不會拉單杠也不會跳木馬
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.27,0:02:33.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過只要一跳上我的筋斗雲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.87,0:02:36.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就可以馬上飛到天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你可以飛過我的手掌心嗎?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也叫做手掌心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本就是土豆嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.94,0:02:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要仔細看好喔
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:54.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就飛到宇宙的盡頭讓你瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:55.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.00,0:03:05.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就要飛過銀河系了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.48,0:03:08.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛到這裏應該就差不多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.29,0:03:12.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼行星啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.85,0:03:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣剛好
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就在上面畫個標記當證據吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.32,0:03:26.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,畫個圈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.70,0:03:27.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再畫個圈
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:33.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再畫個嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.33,0:03:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,釋迦牟尼佛祖他一定會嚇一跳的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.13,0:03:44.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.01,0:03:50.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來你的力量不過如此
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.83,0:03:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為的那顆行星
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實是我的手掌心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.60,0:03:57.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這只愚蠢的猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.08,0:04:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.44,0:04:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求求你放我出去
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.35,0:04:11.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,釋迦牟尼佛祖
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底想怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愛念書
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:17.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又不聽媽媽的話
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:18.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且又愛哭
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還老是喜歡欺負哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.82,0:04:22.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了改掉這些惡習
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.23,0:04:26.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就讓你在這裏悔改五百年吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.37,0:04:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五百年?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.01,0:04:33.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五百年後會有一位叫做玄奘的法師
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.28,0:04:34.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了到天竺取經而路過此地
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就陪他一道去取經
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.36,0:04:39.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後修行你自己吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.38,0:04:41.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要,我才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快放我出去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.98,0:04:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.69,0:04:57.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.47,0:05:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玄奘法師
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.26,0:05:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你在說什麼啊\n該你出場了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.56,0:05:03.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快一點啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.26,0:05:07.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然躲在這打瞌睡
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.51,0:05:09.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼連阿福和技安都來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.08,0:05:15.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點上去啊不快一點的話\n我會打你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.38,0:05:16.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃從石頭裏蹦出來的石猴\n孫悟空是也
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.74,0:05:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.12,0:05:27.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你當你是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.98,0:05:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能讓你演孫悟空呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:33.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你的角色是村人甲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該要說"救命啊"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.61,0:05:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼一句而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.24,0:05:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乾脆把大雄的戲份刪掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.91,0:05:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.76,0:05:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢~
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.24,0:06:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西遊記
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多好的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.22,0:06:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是能辦到該多好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.18,0:06:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那樣的夢 這樣的夢 有好多好多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.88,0:06:13.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一個一個一個地
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都能實現
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.80,0:06:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用那不可思議的小口袋 為我實現
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.59,0:06:25.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好想自由地 在天空飛翔
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.47,0:06:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"給你！這是竹蜻蜓"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.76,0:06:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.17,0:06:33.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.75,0:06:37.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.23,0:06:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 啊 啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好喜歡你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.54,0:06:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.93,0:07:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們怎麼可以擅自刪臺詞呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.88,0:07:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,元開同學\n這劇本是你寫的你有什麼看法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.05,0:07:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使是只有一句對白也是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.40,0:07:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過今天的時間已經不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.34,0:07:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我們從第十四場戲開始排練吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.10,0:07:15.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就從……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:18.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空成為唐三藏的弟子這段開始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:23.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好心的法師\n求你救救我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.92,0:07:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你願意跟我一起到天竺的話\n我就放你出來
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:30.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你是要到天竺或是天涯海角\n我都願意跟你一起去
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.78,0:07:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的嗎\n你可不要騙我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.93,0:07:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼會騙你呢\n我在這裏已經待很久了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:39.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭，好不容易在迎新會上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.02,0:07:40.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有機會參加西遊記的演出的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.57,0:07:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在卻變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.76,0:07:48.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被壓在石頭下五百年真是累慘我了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.47,0:07:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空這個角色比較適應我演的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.35,0:07:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，你還是比較適合演豬八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.35,0:07:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這話什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:07:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有什麼啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.77,0:08:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好，你們演得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.72,0:08:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.85,0:08:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬妖豬八戒的出場
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.83,0:08:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬，換豬出場了\n現在該豬妖出場了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.44,0:08:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少囉嗦\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.55,0:08:15.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要說什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.34,0:08:18.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是一個看起來令人垂涎的女孩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是一個看起來令人垂涎的乳豬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.15,0:08:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為是個女孩原來是一隻猴子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.90,0:08:28.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還以為是只乳豬原來是一出木衫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.30,0:08:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個殘害良家婦女的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.30,0:08:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天一定要收拾你
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.10,0:08:37.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為你打得贏我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.11,0:08:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厲害，你這只豬
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然叫我豬\n你以為你功課好就很了不起嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.04,0:08:43.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個臭小子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:46.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下，等一下啦技安
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.50,0:08:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬八戒要是打倒孫悟空\n那整個戲就全亂了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才說我比較適合演孫悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:55.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:57.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每個人適合的角色個性不同啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.81,0:09:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是啊所以你最適合演河怪沙悟淨了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.12,0:09:03.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以後都不理你了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.33,0:09:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實應該讓最像真的孫悟空的人\n來扮演這個角色的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.50,0:09:10.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的孫悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.64,0:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，根本就沒有真正的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.00,0:09:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有的,一定有的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.21,0:09:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我說大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.16,0:09:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不過是個虛構的故事\n所以孫悟空不可能存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.15,0:09:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我馬上就去證明給你們看\n你們等著瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,證實？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.06,0:09:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真正的孫悟空長得和我一模一樣的話\n這個角色就要給我演喔
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.52,0:09:33.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.91,0:09:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們等著瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.22,0:09:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.27,0:09:38.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要到動物園找只猴子\n告訴我們你們長得很像啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.76,0:09:41.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我們是不會讓你演的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有的，一定有孫悟空的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.01,0:09:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.28,0:10:01.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦……A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.26,0:10:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.80,0:10:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的機器喔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.38,0:10:22.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.18,0:10:27.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能再待在這裏了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.93,0:10:35.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我該到什麼時代的什麼地方去才好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.94,0:10:38.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請告訴我要前往的時代和地點
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.98,0:10:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光機居然會說話了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我已安裝了語音功能的裝置了\n請告訴我你的需求吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.81,0:10:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我想去找孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.39,0:10:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空，我明白了\N查找資料中……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.36,0:10:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球歷史上沒有這個人的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.76,0:11:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，孫悟空是猴子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.27,0:11:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猴子？\n我沒有猴子的資料
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.73,0:11:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼你查查三藏法師\n他是一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.24,0:11:14.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師，我明白了\n查找資料中……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距今大約一千三百五十年前
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.70,0:11:21.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從中國出發到印度取經的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.97,0:11:23.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對，就是這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.34,0:11:26.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要到他到印度旅行時的這段時期
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.19,0:11:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個時候孫悟空應該和他在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.06,0:11:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,629年9月3日從長安出發
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.88,0:11:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這段漫長的旅行歷經十九年\n我們要選那一段時間呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.92,0:11:41.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨便吧，大概找一段時間就行了\n接下來我可以在慢慢找
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.09,0:11:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.66,0:11:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒想到大雄那小子真的笨到那種程度
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.49,0:11:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:58.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是生於七世紀時的中國真正的人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.87,0:12:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那該不會真的有孫悟空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.19,0:12:03.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然沒有，那只是後來的人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.99,0:12:05.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了讓故事更有趣而加入的虛構人物
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.87,0:12:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那個時候要做長途旅行\n一定很辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.34,0:12:12.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是當然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.47,0:12:15.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為當時沒有汽車和飛機啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.98,0:12:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜\n明天見
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:27.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,馬上就要到西元636年8月
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.21,0:12:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亞洲中央的大沙漠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.53,0:12:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師會經過那裏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:37.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有正負24小時的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.54,0:12:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼這麼差勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這已經是電腦的極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.13,0:12:45.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.97,0:12:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏好熱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.40,0:13:03.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師真的會經過這裏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根據電腦的計算是會通過的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.52,0:13:09.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先去找找看再說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.33,0:13:15.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼找啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.20,0:13:30.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來好像找不到的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.03,0:13:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看我還是放棄回家去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.42,0:13:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是飛機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.52,0:13:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個時代該不會有飛機才對
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:52.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是……是孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.73,0:13:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.30,0:14:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有，真的有孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趕快回去告訴大家
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.97,0:14:12.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師，三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.06,0:14:18.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼啊，他不是三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你振作一點
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.75,0:14:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.64,0:14:34.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……\n這裏怎麼可能會有水呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.38,0:14:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.65,0:14:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這裏有沒有水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.58,0:14:43.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的儲備箱裏有存放的一點緊急用水
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.07,0:14:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把水拿來了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:50.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快喝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.83,0:15:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.63,0:15:05.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.07,0:15:08.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是說我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.08,0:15:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你救了我\n這是你第二次救我了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.40,0:15:14.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起，我還要趕路
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.40,0:15:16.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個我……
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.77,0:15:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了我問你一下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.50,0:15:22.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問還有什麼事情嗎，孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.38,0:15:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼\n你要小心喔
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道我長得跟孫悟空一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.69,0:15:31.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待會見\n我會帶大家一起來的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.80,0:16:15.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於撐到最後一關了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.57,0:16:32.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是最後一關\n這裏果然有大怪獸守住城堡
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.59,0:16:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，再加把勁
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.98,0:16:44.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗嘗我哆啦A夢國王寶劍的厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.89,0:16:55.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.20,0:16:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你哆啦A夢國王
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.01,0:17:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已經闖過了遊戲的所有關卡
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.45,0:17:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直相信你會來救我的\n你果然是天神派來的勇士
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.04,0:17:14.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要客氣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.71,0:17:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你，哆啦A夢國王
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.04,0:17:32.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好玩了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.07,0:17:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等大雄回來\n我們可以一起玩個雙打的遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.22,0:17:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄他一定會很高興的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.48,0:17:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的書包怎麼會在這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.30,0:17:57.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.13,0:17:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了，找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:00.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到誰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.43,0:18:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這還用問嗎\n當然是孫悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.20,0:18:04.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.91,0:18:06.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去告訴大家這個好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了\n等一下，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.30,0:18:10.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.26,0:18:17.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家才想跟他一起玩這個剛才未來百貨公司\n送來的虛擬實境遊戲機呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就知道
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.06,0:18:24.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們大家都在這裏
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.91,0:18:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.22,0:18:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到孫悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.76,0:18:30.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是不剛相信
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.75,0:18:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那種事只有在漫畫才會出現吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是真的而且他長得跟我一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.09,0:18:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.90,0:18:39.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你有照片可以證明嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是親眼看到的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.89,0:18:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我看你是做夢夢到的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們大家現在一起去看看嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.37,0:18:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿福，你耳朵過來一下\n做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.23,0:18:50.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:53.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空是神話故事裏的虛擬人物耶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.74,0:18:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到連宜靜也要懷疑我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.46,0:18:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:19:00.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你真的看到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.52,0:19:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我發誓是真的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.34,0:19:04.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你說謊的話怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.77,0:19:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢的道具全部任我們使用\n可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.55,0:19:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部任你們使用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.71,0:19:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底怎麼樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.04,0:19:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.95,0:19:21.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說孫悟空也有戴眼鏡囉
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.86,0:19:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.04,0:19:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的有戴眼鏡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.01,0:19:33.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家怎麼都來了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.43,0:19:35.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太巧了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.47,0:19:36.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢你也跟我們一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.80,0:19:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在正要去買銅鑼燒呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個待會再買啦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.08,0:19:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧，去吧\n要去哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.96,0:19:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走吧\n一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.61,0:19:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.11,0:19:48.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在西遊記之旅即將開始
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.51,0:19:50.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西遊記？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.79,0:19:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點，快點
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.07,0:19:53.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.63,0:19:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢也一起來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.80,0:20:05.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帶我們到剛才的時間地點
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.36,0:20:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.88,0:20:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為時間會有正負24小時的差距
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.90,0:20:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是這樣的話不就見不到孫悟空了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這已經是電腦的最大極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.97,0:20:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別囉嗦了快點給我馬上出發
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.44,0:20:18.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.02,0:20:27.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.46,0:20:34.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛死我了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.84,0:20:35.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.62,0:20:38.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給它裝上自動裝置之後動作就變得粗暴了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:43.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏跟上次來的地方根本就不一樣嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.19,0:20:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有我一直強調這是電腦的最大極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.94,0:20:47.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，孫悟空到底在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.63,0:20:49.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才我一個人來的時候\n我真的看到孫悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.91,0:20:56.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.41,0:20:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們該不會跑到奇怪的地方來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.58,0:21:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.14,0:21:07.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.71,0:21:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快點躲起來
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.06,0:21:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快躲起來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:24.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想\n這應該就是中國唐朝時的強盜集團吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.48,0:21:25.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,強盜集團
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.01,0:21:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n這究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.89,0:21:37.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為技安他們說想親眼看看孫悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.46,0:21:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼，想看看孫悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.65,0:21:47.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的親眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.80,0:21:50.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且後來又來了一個小男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.14,0:21:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他還叫我孫悟空呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.80,0:21:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的這麼叫你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.03,0:21:56.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:01.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄從你什麼時候聽得懂中國話了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.69,0:22:04.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又沒有吃翻譯果凍
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.54,0:22:08.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能會聽得懂中國小男孩說的話呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.21,0:22:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.07,0:22:18.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.16,0:22:21.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任他們隨意使用我的道具
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我真的很有自信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.53,0:22:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼可以擅自答應他們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.73,0:22:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.93,0:22:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們大家都沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.67,0:22:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不想再遇到這樣的危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.14,0:22:45.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點讓我看到孫悟空吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.97,0:22:48.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要急嘛，先看看情況再說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.24,0:22:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少囉嗦\n你們過來一下
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.92,0:22:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.29,0:23:02.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.42,0:23:05.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事，什麼事啊\n哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.15,0:23:06.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:08.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很可能是三藏法師和他的隨從
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.17,0:23:09.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們過去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.15,0:23:11.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，這樣太危險了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這裏有個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:15.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『間諜衛星』
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.04,0:23:18.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,STOP
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再接近一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.55,0:23:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.07,0:23:32.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是旅行中的和尚
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.71,0:23:34.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再靠近一點
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.10,0:23:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.72,0:23:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我剛才在電腦螢幕上見過這個人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.08,0:23:49.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到他跟想像中的不一樣\n看起來強壯多了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是當然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.14,0:23:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為這是一段很艱辛的旅程啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就說過有這個人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.92,0:24:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄三藏法師是真實存在的人物\n所以有這個人是很正常的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.40,0:24:03.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空不是應該陪三藏法師去取經的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他現在在哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.95,0:24:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那只是神話故事擺了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.82,0:24:11.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有豬八戒和沙悟淨也都是虛構的人物啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.77,0:24:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你可要信守你的諾言喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.45,0:24:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.72,0:24:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.48,0:24:25.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們現在看到的是真正的三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.33,0:24:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\n我們現在正在目睹歷史上的重要一頁
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.63,0:24:31.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太令人感動了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.16,0:24:39.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在怎麼辦，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.37,0:24:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我們能找到那個男孩子的話就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.18,0:24:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你還在說這個
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.39,0:24:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法了\n我們現在只好這麼做了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.18,0:24:54.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不是剛才放在我房間的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.62,0:24:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，這就是虛擬實境遊戲機
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.27,0:24:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點進去裏面吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.44,0:25:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.75,0:25:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別問那麼多了快趁大家還沒有發現的時候進去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.49,0:25:06.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西遊記……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.29,0:25:07.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.85,0:25:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你先暫時聽電腦的吩咐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.37,0:25:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.80,0:25:18.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到虛擬實境遊戲機
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.24,0:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.18,0:25:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我們為您選擇適合您的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.11,0:25:29.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我變成孫悟空了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗雲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.33,0:25:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有如意棒
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.76,0:25:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道這些東西是不是真的都可以用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.83,0:25:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可以隨心所欲地使用筋斗雲
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.14,0:25:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你自己本身也有七十二般變化\n絕對不會有變不出來的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.19,0:25:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼，現在遊戲就要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.90,0:25:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你好好地享受這一場遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.34,0:26:04.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太美妙了\n好像在做夢一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.89,0:26:09.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齊天大聖孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.76,0:26:15.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼快就有妖怪出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.74,0:26:21.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.92,0:26:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:29.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄……
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.23,0:26:31.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.64,0:26:33.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.01,0:26:35.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:39.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把遊戲機打開了\n你馬上出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.78,0:26:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.54,0:26:44.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還沒將妖怪全部打倒耶
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:49.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲先玩到這裏為止你快點用這個樣子出來
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.54,0:26:52.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣的話技安他們就會相信你的話了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.82,0:26:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此\n我差點就忘了你真聰明
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.40,0:27:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁大家還沒有發現\n動作快一點，快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.98,0:27:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n你必須把自己當作真正的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.39,0:27:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了嗎\n我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.36,0:27:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到外面來之後你也可以像在遊戲機裏一樣行動自如
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.18,0:27:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你可以放心
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.81,0:27:15.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎，真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.77,0:27:18.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄不要太放鬆了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.78,0:27:20.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.43,0:27:25.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先出去通知大家然後你再從那裏飛出來
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家，悟空出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.17,0:27:29.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.93,0:27:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.31,0:27:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空出現了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.57,0:27:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那裏
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.27,0:27:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.65,0:27:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶\n是孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.14,0:27:50.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過他為什麼要背對我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.36,0:27:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能是不好意思吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.22,0:27:56.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好帥，孫悟空\n請你看這邊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.82,0:27:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.68,0:28:02.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他聽得懂日語耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.05,0:28:05.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為他是齊天大聖啊這點小事當然難不倒他
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.65,0:28:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真的是孫悟空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.16,0:28:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我乃真正的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.84,0:28:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟大雄長得一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.00,0:28:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.27,0:28:23.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.68,0:28:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了，他一定是真的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.77,0:28:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空……
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.37,0:28:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,掉下來了\n他這樣真的可以打妖怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.80,0:28:44.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，大雄呢
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.88,0:28:48.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那裏尿尿
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.32,0:28:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真可惜孫悟空好不容易出現了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.17,0:28:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思慚愧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.02,0:28:56.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.06,0:28:58.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.08,0:29:00.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不會啊，我也不是很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.68,0:29:02.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定很忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.66,0:29:04.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不忙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.16,0:29:08.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過三藏法師已經往那邊走了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.07,0:29:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.19,0:29:15.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個孫悟空……\n我可以跟你握個手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:17.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好，我也要
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.52,0:29:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行，宜靜才可以
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.58,0:29:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，既然這樣的話\n讓你們看看我的拿手絕活
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.46,0:29:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先讓這支如意棒變大
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.04,0:29:38.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太大了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.32,0:29:42.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空，你振作一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.71,0:29:45.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救救我啊\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.64,0:29:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要緊吧哪有這麼笨的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.74,0:29:50.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救救我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.97,0:29:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:58.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.53,0:30:02.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三，用力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.29,0:30:04.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛……
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.34,0:30:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，如意棒變小
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一開始這樣就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.63,0:30:37.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼，我還有很多事要忙\n下次再找你們玩吧再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.46,0:30:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見\n加油啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.35,0:30:40.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會的
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.39,0:30:42.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.87,0:30:44.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.24,0:30:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是大雄啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.13,0:30:53.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的我就知道是這麼回事\n我剛才就一直在懷疑了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.49,0:30:59.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你還記得我們的約定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.70,0:31:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快點回去\n一起玩剛才那個虛擬實境遊戲機
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.11,0:31:14.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說是吧，阿福\n真是太令人期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.18,0:31:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，我不是交代過你了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.92,0:31:20.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢每次拿出來的道具\n都沒有什麼好結果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.66,0:31:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只會把責任推給道具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.90,0:31:25.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是你沒有眼光挑選道具
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.35,0:31:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這麼說你這個人就簡直是沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.04,0:31:30.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，我是沒救了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.10,0:31:40.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.21,0:31:47.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點把剛才那個道具拿出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.39,0:31:51.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道\n真拿你沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.16,0:31:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要玩什麼遊戲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.98,0:32:04.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是西遊記啊\n而且我要演孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.01,0:32:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.37,0:32:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我演別的也可以啦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.68,0:32:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都站上去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.63,0:32:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你也跟我們一起玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.13,0:32:15.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.56,0:32:18.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正大雄可以扮演村人甲的角色啊
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.95,0:32:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲就要開始了\n你們要聽從機器的指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.13,0:32:24.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.54,0:32:26.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.13,0:32:36.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是氣死人了這個任性的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.21,0:32:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.05,0:32:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請我為各位選擇適合各人的角色
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.01,0:32:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,服裝已經換好了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.77,0:32:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齊天大聖孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.29,0:33:00.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.65,0:33:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，這究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.45,0:33:05.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道啊這是電腦決定的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.85,0:33:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就說技安你還是比較適合當豬八戒吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.81,0:33:12.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡，人家想當孫悟空嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.42,0:33:15.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,八戒，注意你的言行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.51,0:33:19.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇塞宜靜已經完全變成三藏法師了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:23.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼現在遊戲就要開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.84,0:33:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你們好好地享受這一場遊戲吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.79,0:33:42.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有什麼隨時會跑出來似的\n好可怕喔
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.49,0:33:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.59,0:33:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我技安會保護大家的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是豬八戒吧\n少囉嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.09,0:33:51.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是好奇怪耶\n妖怪應該馬上出現的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.34,0:33:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出現了，不要退縮！
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.60,0:33:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空，沙悟淨
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.58,0:33:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.09,0:34:02.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.75,0:34:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遊戲機該不會是壞掉了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.69,0:34:07.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.82,0:34:08.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才想問你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.62,0:34:10.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是已經玩過這個遊戲了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.86,0:34:12.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.05,0:34:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師你們終於通過這遊戲的所有關卡
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.26,0:34:22.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來到天竺了希望下次我們有機會再見
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.44,0:34:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經結束了\n連一隻妖怪也沒有出現耶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.87,0:34:32.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們不覺得這個遊戲機怪怪的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.17,0:34:39.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.35,0:34:42.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們動作真快，很好玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.46,0:34:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里好玩啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.68,0:34:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們根本就連一隻妖怪也沒有遇到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.21,0:34:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有其他的遊戲了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.72,0:34:52.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.75,0:34:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天已經不早了\n明天再繼續玩吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.37,0:34:56.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.47,0:34:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我媽媽會擔心的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.11,0:35:05.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了\n大雄，明天學校見
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.55,0:35:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.48,0:35:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\n明天也要任我們使用喔
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.50,0:35:14.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.08,0:35:15.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦，真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.74,0:35:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.70,0:35:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這都是大雄你害的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.70,0:35:38.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好怪異的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.75,0:35:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，哆啦A夢\n吃飯了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.05,0:35:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.90,0:35:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.26,0:35:56.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.51,0:36:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個炸雞塊好好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.99,0:36:09.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶，真的很好吃喔
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.49,0:36:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，吃飯的時候不要看報紙
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.38,0:36:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，爸……爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.05,0:36:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.83,0:36:24.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼了，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.60,0:36:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒……什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個炸雞塊真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.42,0:36:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.89,0:36:36.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是用大雄最喜歡的青蛙肉和蛇肉去炸的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.26,0:36:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓大家久等了這是爸爸最喜歡的\n蜥蜴大補湯
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.97,0:36:48.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道聞起來真不錯啊
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:50.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.32,0:36:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是奇怪的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.16,0:36:55.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.65,0:37:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有什麼鬼怪
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.33,0:37:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到底是什麼地方出了錯
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.14,0:37:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道是
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.98,0:37:26.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.92,0:37:29.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說什麼，哆啦A夢\n大雄你又想說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.54,0:37:30.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢你現說
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.97,0:37:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你為什麼不先說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.94,0:37:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愛逞強
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.39,0:37:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去上學了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.37,0:38:14.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你願意換取心臟以後為妖怪世界盡一份力的話
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.79,0:38:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就原諒你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.17,0:38:17.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.57,0:38:21.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後我會為妖怪世界盡心盡力的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.63,0:38:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.46,0:38:24.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家一起把唐三藏給吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.27,0:38:28.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，該你上場了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.06,0:38:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是為什麼唐三藏會被吃掉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.30,0:38:36.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是西遊記耶\n最後邪惡的唐三藏被吃掉是當然的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.23,0:38:38.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有這麼荒誕的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哪有妖怪會戰勝人類的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.90,0:38:47.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是當然的啊\n我從來沒聽說過妖怪會輸給人類的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.43,0:38:49.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們四個今天是怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.91,0:38:52.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪的人是你們吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.26,0:38:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.67,0:38:57.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管是什麼故事結局一定都是人類滅亡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.59,0:39:00.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安，出木衫今天好奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.98,0:39:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只是出木衫\n除了我們四個人以外大家都變的奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.14,0:39:10.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不這樣的話\n我們妖怪要怎麼生存在這個世界上呢
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.90,0:39:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們有認真的排練嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.24,0:39:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話劇的排練進行的順利吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.24,0:39:20.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師對你們這次的演出抱著很大的期望喔
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.27,0:39:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老師
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.16,0:39:24.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那邊的四個人不願意配合排練
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.04,0:39:29.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的\n我們只是說妖怪會戰勝人類這樣實在太奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.49,0:39:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果三藏法師被吃掉的話\n這樣的西遊記不是很可笑嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.02,0:39:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣有什麼可笑的
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:41.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們究竟是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.47,0:39:44.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.08,0:39:49.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.83,0:39:52.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我……我也不知道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.44,0:39:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從早上就覺得事情太不對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.39,0:40:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這到底是怎麼回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.19,0:40:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從昨天晚上開始就覺得有點怪怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.77,0:40:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該是從我們進入哆啦A夢的虛擬實境遊戲機\n玩西遊記的時候就開始了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.15,0:40:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯，這都是哆啦A夢害的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.15,0:40:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼這麼說
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.82,0:40:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之，我要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.37,0:40:22.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也要回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.49,0:40:26.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你一定要和哆啦A夢把事情弄清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.48,0:40:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.25,0:40:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.28,0:40:30.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們都要回家了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.06,0:40:32.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂~
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.74,0:40:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，回答我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.56,0:40:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.90,0:40:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,輕點，輕點
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.15,0:41:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.03,0:41:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經知道了事情不太對勁了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.58,0:41:09.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我們現在該怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.27,0:41:10.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.77,0:41:12.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學校方面怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.57,0:41:16.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了我們之外大家好像都已經變成妖怪了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.20,0:41:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜還說是不是因為我們進入那個遊戲機\n所以事情才會變得這麼奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.40,0:41:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.72,0:41:23.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.83,0:41:29.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你回來了吧為什麼不說一聲呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.25,0:41:31.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.89,0:41:33.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.49,0:41:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你該不會又把零分考卷藏起來了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.05,0:41:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.24,0:41:39.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼會這樣做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.43,0:41:42.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要乖乖做功課喔，聽到了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.20,0:41:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.29,0:41:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽怎麼會變成那個樣子啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.33,0:41:51.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，我們先到街上瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.24,0:42:01.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乍看起來和平常沒有什麼兩樣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.60,0:42:05.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過總覺得空氣裏彌漫著一股妖氣
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.16,0:42:08.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們應該不會進入妖怪的世界裏了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.54,0:42:13.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該不會\n不然這裏怎麼會有我們的家和學校呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.09,0:42:14.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣不是很奇怪嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.72,0:42:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那究竟是怎麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.21,0:42:18.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看那邊
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.18,0:42:41.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏應該沒有這樣的塔才對啊\n我們靠近點看看
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.35,0:42:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等我啊，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽頭上的角
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.51,0:42:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有變身成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.51,0:43:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是因為那座塔讓妖怪的世界慢慢入侵所造成的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.62,0:43:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.57,0:43:09.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西遊記排練後來變成什麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.49,0:43:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結果很奇怪\n因為結局後來變成唐三藏被妖怪吃掉
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.83,0:43:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼，果然從那個時候開始歷史就已經改變了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.56,0:43:19.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.06,0:43:21.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.08,0:43:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點，快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.89,0:43:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點嘛，快拿個什麼道具出來
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.10,0:43:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了『蝙蝠剋星槍』
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.11,0:43:53.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.14,0:43:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.30,0:43:58.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過他們為什麼要攻擊我們呢
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.45,0:44:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想一定是因為他們知道你是人類
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.72,0:44:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.27,0:44:06.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其他的三個人也會有危險
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.17,0:44:07.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\n好
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.93,0:44:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.94,0:44:34.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.37,0:44:36.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽……媽媽她……
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.69,0:44:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.96,0:44:41.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，我們還是先回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.17,0:44:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要出聲
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.56,0:44:53.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.56,0:44:56.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.36,0:44:59.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.65,0:45:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歷史改變了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.02,0:45:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓別人知道我們是人類的話就糟糕了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.74,0:45:06.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼會這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.40,0:45:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼事情會變成這樣呢
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.12,0:45:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨天我們不是搭乘時光機到唐朝去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.97,0:45:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候虛擬實境遊戲機我一直開著
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.56,0:45:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西遊記遊戲軟體裏的妖怪\n一定是趁那時候跑到現實世界來了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.27,0:45:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些妖怪們是被設定要吃掉唐三藏的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.43,0:45:30.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說的話
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.34,0:45:33.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話劇裏唐三藏會被吃掉的結局……
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.22,0:45:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.03,0:45:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這已經變成真實的歷史了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.49,0:45:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼，為什麼這裏會變成這樣呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.52,0:45:42.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既然唐三藏已經被吃掉了故事不就應該結束了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.76,0:45:49.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們沒有因此而消失反而慢慢進化
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.61,0:45:51.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們利用本身的妖術終於連整個世界
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.73,0:45:54.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是這個地球也都陷入他們的魔掌之中
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.66,0:45:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後連歷史也都被他們給支配了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.26,0:46:05.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼事情會變成這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.82,0:46:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.60,0:46:11.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道我們沒有辦法回到原來的世界嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.97,0:46:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，只有我們再度回到唐朝\n把妖怪們全部收服就可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.94,0:46:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.23,0:46:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼說我們要真的演出西遊記了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.83,0:46:25.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有錯
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.35,0:46:28.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看你說的這麼簡單
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.78,0:46:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這全部是因為你的道具不好\n所以事情才會變成這樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.53,0:46:34.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道，我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.82,0:46:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算回到唐朝有什麼\n用對手可是稱霸地球的妖怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.66,0:46:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們怎麼可能會贏嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.24,0:46:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是要你們跟妖怪們打架
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.54,0:46:44.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是要讓妖怪們回到機器裏
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.49,0:46:46.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之，我們快點動手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.13,0:46:50.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，既然對手是虛擬實境遊戲機裏的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.29,0:46:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們也打扮成西遊記裏的人物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.51,0:46:55.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.44,0:46:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我還要當豬八戒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.23,0:46:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還要繼續當河怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.92,0:47:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在已經沒有時間計較這個了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.10,0:47:02.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.80,0:47:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.11,0:47:05.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,樓上是不是有朋友來了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.81,0:47:08.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有別人來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.88,0:47:10.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.53,0:47:12.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,功課做完了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.74,0:47:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做完了的話就去幫媽媽買東西
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.05,0:47:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.02,0:47:19.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.82,0:47:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.25,0:47:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了我是不是聽錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.89,0:47:34.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒有被設定新的歷史\n所以請自己用手動設定
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.98,0:47:38.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該沒有改變很多你不能幫幫忙嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.16,0:47:45.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,時光亂流處於第一失重狀態歷史發生重大改變\n這是異常現象
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.22,0:47:48.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.94,0:47:51.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢，不要緊吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.94,0:47:53.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.80,0:49:43.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那上面走
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.51,0:50:16.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師這整座廟裏都沒有人煙
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.87,0:50:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也沒有辦法我們就先在這裏休息一會吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.42,0:50:21.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.08,0:50:25.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小楊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.45,0:50:28.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們在一起已經幾天了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.39,0:50:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是，我已經跟你在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.50,0:50:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到今天已經十天了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.08,0:50:34.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自我從長安出發以來已經過了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.99,0:50:38.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道有多少弟子因為無法吃苦而離去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.96,0:50:41.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小楊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.36,0:50:43.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.18,0:50:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏距離天竺還有一段很遙遠的路程
Dialogue: 0,0:50:47.08,0:50:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以吃得了苦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.83,0:50:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.56,0:51:00.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，我們也該出發了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.79,0:51:01.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.64,0:51:51.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角，他就是唐三藏嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.91,0:51:57.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該就是他了吧\n聽說吃了他的肉可以長生不老呢，銀角
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.70,0:52:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還沒到嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:17.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想應該差不多該到了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.16,0:52:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可不要帶我們到什麼奇怪的地方去啊
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.29,0:52:21.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，我這裏有一個好東西
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.14,0:52:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『危險警報員』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.61,0:52:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.29,0:52:31.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管在什麼地方只要有危險他都會通知我們
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如說妖怪來的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.51,0:52:36.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.22,0:52:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.31,0:52:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏怎麼沒有妖怪呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.00,0:52:43.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不會搞錯吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.60,0:52:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個風景
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.87,0:52:48.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏應該就是中國大陸的某一角不會錯的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.74,0:52:50.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正就是……
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.03,0:52:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『翻譯果凍』
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.36,0:52:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.22,0:52:57.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你確定這裏真的是唐朝嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.17,0:52:58.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先聽我說
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.26,0:52:59.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏確定是中國大陸
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.88,0:53:01.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們大家會說中國話嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.81,0:53:05.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連語言都不通怎麼辦事\n對不對？
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.50,0:53:08.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\n謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.44,0:53:09.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.28,0:53:12.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.71,0:53:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.86,0:53:22.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可怕
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.52,0:53:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看那邊那不是三藏法師嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.00,0:53:34.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是他，那這一定是……
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.36,0:53:36.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他們幹的
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.66,0:53:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.33,0:53:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在該上場將他們回收了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.57,0:53:43.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.54,0:53:45.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快點把道具拿出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒告訴你們嗎\n你們可以像在遊戲中一樣擁有一身的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.54,0:53:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.70,0:53:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼不早點說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.54,0:53:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗雲
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.30,0:54:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好，真好
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.30,0:54:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閃避披風……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.79,0:54:08.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼還沒有抓到唐三藏啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.34,0:54:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你們了，你們這些妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.82,0:54:17.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們該不會是金角銀角吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.93,0:54:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.85,0:54:22.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪了，你們不認識我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.47,0:54:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誰認識你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.76,0:54:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點報上名來
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.78,0:54:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不是平常那個膽小的大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.30,0:54:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是齊天大聖孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.19,0:54:34.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.21,0:54:36.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有他的夥伴哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我豬八戒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.81,0:54:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是沙悟淨
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.27,0:54:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭，只有大雄一個人當英雄
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.67,0:54:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是說嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.23,0:54:46.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，你們還是乖乖地……
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.31,0:54:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回到虛擬實境遊戲機裏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.77,0:54:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼\n可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.18,0:54:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我收拾你們
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.33,0:54:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了，來了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.60,0:55:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要過來，不要過來
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.61,0:55:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.90,0:55:11.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點進虛擬實境遊戲機裏去
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.73,0:55:14.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼啊你這個短腿的醉狸貓
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.63,0:55:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是狸貓
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.90,0:55:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是說過我叫做哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.55,0:55:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.26,0:55:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師，你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.27,0:55:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.85,0:55:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們究竟是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.89,0:55:34.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就說來話長了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.53,0:55:37.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定會保護你不讓妖怪吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.66,0:55:38.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.65,0:55:42.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你放心哆啦A夢一定會護送你到天竺的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.27,0:55:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢？
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.40,0:55:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.73,0:55:47.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,千萬不能回答他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.78,0:55:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.22,0:55:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答的話你會被吸入他的葫蘆裏的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.41,0:55:54.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有……
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.12,0:56:01.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋，他已經被我吸入葫蘆裏了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.45,0:56:03.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我們就有狸貓酒可以喝了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.39,0:56:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點把那個和尚抓回來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.47,0:56:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.99,0:56:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點融化吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.27,0:56:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.07,0:56:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角，快把那個葫蘆給我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.21,0:56:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不要咧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.91,0:56:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非等到那只狸貓融化不然我是不會把葫蘆打開的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.72,0:56:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎麼可能被融化呢
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.20,0:56:31.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可是二十二世紀的貓型機器人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.67,0:56:33.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是搞不清狀況
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.44,0:56:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是笨傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.49,0:56:37.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任意門
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.75,0:56:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走開……混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.67,0:56:43.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要緊吧，阿福
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.34,0:56:44.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.58,0:56:49.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經快要被融化了
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.94,0:56:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.98,0:56:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢他被吸入葫蘆裏了\n怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.79,0:56:57.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎，要不要緊啊\n他怎麼會在葫蘆裏
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.91,0:57:01.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點小事你們用不著為我擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.84,0:57:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.97,0:57:05.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你什麼時候逃出來的？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.75,0:57:07.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金角
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:08.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.90,0:57:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回收成功
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.39,0:57:18.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來要回收這麼容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.55,0:57:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.86,0:57:22.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.54,0:57:24.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走開
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.46,0:57:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁你們還沒吃到苦頭前\n你們還是快點把唐三藏交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.85,0:57:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點把唐三藏交給……
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.51,0:57:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀角
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.74,0:57:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我孫悟空來當你的對手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.41,0:57:53.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛喔\n你不要緊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.96,0:57:54.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.64,0:57:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.60,0:58:00.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在這麼危險的時候救了我們\n真是非常感謝你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.61,0:58:04.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這沒什麼這點小事那稱得上救呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.41,0:58:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪，你不是那時候的男孩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.43,0:58:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你認識他嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.85,0:58:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.76,0:58:14.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.87,0:58:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.68,0:58:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.18,0:58:21.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以那個時候你才會叫我孫悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.92,0:58:23.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個時候？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.30,0:58:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這是第一次見到你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.08,0:58:28.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正以後我們還會有機會見面的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.48,0:58:30.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.19,0:58:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，你沒受傷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.33,0:58:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的動作真是太慢了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.56,0:58:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀角已經被我一個人給打跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.16,0:58:38.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想說因為你是孫悟空嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.81,0:58:41.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，本孫悟空大人打跑的
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.38,0:58:42.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還不是因為遊戲機的緣故
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.97,0:58:47.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們這些人為什麼要保護我呢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.73,0:58:49.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是因為這個哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.27,0:58:51.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿出一些莫名其妙的道具\N不是的，那個……
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.52,0:58:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是正好經過的正義使者啦
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.01,0:58:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少給我裝糊塗
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.15,0:59:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來的路程
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.19,0:59:10.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會盡全力保護三藏法師的\n請各位不用操心
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.93,0:59:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,繼續你們的旅程吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.22,0:59:14.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.83,0:59:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很謝謝你們
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.20,0:59:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼我們要繼續趕路了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.26,0:59:24.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重\n再見……
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.46,0:59:27.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路上小心\n要小心一點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.29,0:59:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也要小心一點
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.46,0:59:31.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.59,0:59:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣看起來我們的時間和地點都選對了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.93,0:59:40.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到我可以和三藏法師本人說話\n真是太令人感動了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.51,0:59:44.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有你不要忘記現在的我是孫悟空喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.53,0:59:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不要忘了這都是虛擬實境遊戲機的功勞喔
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.15,0:59:49.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道啦
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.62,0:59:55.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢，我們現在要怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.21,0:59:58.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們必須加速前往
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.31,1:00:01.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將所有的妖怪都收回遊戲機裏
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.54,1:00:05.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，你要多辛苦一點繼續扮演三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.95,1:00:06.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.53,1:00:09.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，出發
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.48,1:00:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.66,1:00:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.34,1:00:14.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忘記帶時光機了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.98,1:00:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思，不好意思
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.17,1:00:25.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害，好厲害的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.17,1:00:27.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把出現的妖怪都一網打盡
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.16,1:00:31.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稀裏嘩啦地擊敗它們
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.57,1:00:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空真厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.50,1:00:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師真的會經過這裏面嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.78,1:00:40.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歷史上是這麼記載的他應該從這裏經過的
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.71,1:00:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像去游泳喔
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.22,1:00:44.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.67,1:00:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厲害，好厲害的孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.09,1:00:51.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當上了主角就這麼得意
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.18,1:00:55.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要降服牛魔王應該就沒這麼容易了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.98,1:01:01.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空非常厲害的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.21,1:01:11.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.19,1:01:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你給我閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.73,1:01:15.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為你的緣故
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.09,1:01:17.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,害得我們的計畫都泡湯了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.24,1:01:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的間諜已經到唐三藏身邊了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.76,1:01:22.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,間諜？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.06,1:01:24.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒錯，間諜
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.06,1:01:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你居然破壞了整個計畫
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.29,1:01:29.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋\n真的很對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.35,1:01:31.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我擅作主張
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.13,1:01:34.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老公，你說怎麼辦呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.30,1:01:35.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算怎麼處置這個笨蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.93,1:01:40.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請再給我一次將功贖罪的機會
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.32,1:01:43.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會把唐三藏給抓回來的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.04,1:02:02.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.78,1:02:05.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼不唱歌了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.18,1:02:07.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在哪里還有心情唱歌啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.04,1:02:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.07,1:02:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個沙漠怎麼都走不完啊
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.72,1:02:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我走不動了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.78,1:02:14.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經沒有力氣了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.59,1:02:16.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.04,1:02:20.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢而且路上連一隻妖怪都沒看到
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.04,1:02:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天就到此為止吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.09,1:02:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贊成
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.25,1:02:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢，你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.38,1:02:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種地方怎麼能休息呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.90,1:02:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點把軟綿綿的床拿來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.38,1:02:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想洗個舒服的澡
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.30,1:02:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要五分熟的牛排
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.60,1:02:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要豬排飯就夠了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.02,1:02:40.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們真是太奢侈了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.20,1:02:46.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『露營膠囊』
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.38,1:03:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,會不會太誇張了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.78,1:03:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一點也不誇張
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.00,1:03:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還真有精神嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.42,1:03:11.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要這個房間
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.69,1:03:12.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我要這邊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.88,1:03:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這裏好了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.84,1:03:15.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就那邊了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.29,1:03:23.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，二十分鐘後準備用餐
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.19,1:03:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請在大廳的餐桌前集合
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.17,1:03:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽到了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.93,1:03:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽，我發誓等我打倒妖怪之後\n我一定會馬上回家找你的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.69,1:03:51.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼只有這種睡衣
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.04,1:03:54.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是傷腦筋
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.28,1:03:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就先湊合湊合吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:00.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開動了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.87,1:04:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,豬排飯
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.30,1:04:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.72,1:04:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,味道怎麼樣啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.14,1:04:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.91,1:04:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根媽媽做的菜比起來稍微差一點
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.00,1:04:20.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我媽媽做的菜好吃多了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.64,1:04:23.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安你太吵了你吃飯的時候不能小點聲嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.45,1:04:25.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吃飽了
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.32,1:04:26.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也太快了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.19,1:04:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可以在這個享樂嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.97,1:04:32.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼這麼說
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.78,1:04:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為一想到三藏法師他現在正做艱辛的旅行啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.76,1:05:07.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天就要進入沙漠地區了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.33,1:05:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那會很艱苦的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.72,1:05:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已經有所覺悟了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.20,1:05:13.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天晚上就好好休息吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.64,1:05:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.76,1:05:19.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.89,1:05:45.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.27,1:05:50.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了小心起見還是把危險報警員放著好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.06,1:05:52.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣我就能安心睡覺了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.51,1:06:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.77,1:06:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼還不睡啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.26,1:06:14.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜你也一樣啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.78,1:06:18.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我從來沒有見過這麼美麗的星空
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.43,1:06:21.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是沒錯\n可是在這個星空下
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.48,1:06:22.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想妖怪也躲在某個角落吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.59,1:06:23.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.29,1:06:28.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.40,1:06:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定孫悟空……
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.48,1:06:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是虛構的人物
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.92,1:06:37.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空一定就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.57,1:06:39.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.79,1:06:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吵死人了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.08,1:06:51.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天又還沒亮
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.09,1:07:33.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那接下來就拜託你了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.14,1:08:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,南無阿彌陀佛……
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.00,1:08:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們要做什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.51,1:08:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.38,1:09:25.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，出發
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.90,1:09:30.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.74,1:09:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們不是來這裏睡覺的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.15,1:09:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出發了，出發了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.19,1:09:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在時間還早嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪們也一定還在睡覺
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.77,1:09:42.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.37,1:09:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果讓三藏法師趕到我們前面就不好了\n真是的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.19,1:09:49.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.02,1:09:52.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就搭乘你的筋斗雲先到附件去探查一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.55,1:09:54.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.36,1:09:55.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,筋斗雲
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.55,1:09:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有這個時候
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.18,1:10:01.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們才會把我當成孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.49,1:10:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.56,1:10:15.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放眼望去都是沙漠嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.95,1:10:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏好熱喔
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.80,1:10:36.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.40,1:10:54.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師……
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.62,1:10:56.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,水……我要喝水
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.15,1:10:59.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是三藏法師
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.04,1:11:06.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏一定就是綠洲了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.08,1:11:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先休息一下再走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.37,1:11:18.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.40,1:11:24.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這不該會是……
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.31,1:11:26.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火焰山吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.30,1:11:45.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,妖怪們一定都住在裏面
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.11,1:11:47.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道可不可以進得去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.67,1:11:54.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛……燙死我了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.89,1:11:57.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行不通根本無法靠近
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.79,1:12:00.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對了，好像有個東西可以熄滅這個火
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.75,1:12:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答對了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.50,1:12:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要用我的芭蕉扇一揮就可以熄滅了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.17,1:12:11.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是鐵扇公主了快點把芭蕉扇交給我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.15,1:12:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這怎麼可能交給你呢
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.03,1:12:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢……
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.40,1:12:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.90,1:12:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是捧他幾句就飛上天了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.24,1:12:40.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊，他未免太得意忘形了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.71,1:12:45.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.25,1:12:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你終於出現了，銀角
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.47,1:12:50.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來找你們替金角報仇了\n你們要有所覺悟
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.17,1:12:53.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定會把你打的落花流水的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.08,1:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.78,1:12:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是三藏法師吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.80,1:12:59.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們只要乖乖把他交給我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.26,1:13:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就答應放你們一條生路
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.10,1:13:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要開玩笑了\n我們絕對不會讓你帶走他的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.24,1:13:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們想嘗到苦頭嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.75,1:13:06.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的\n好痛
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.65,1:13:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.81,1:13:10.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.19,1:13:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢，快想想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.19,1:13:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等，冷……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.22,1:13:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜一點
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.37,1:13:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺悟吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.58,1:13:24.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,覺悟吧……你這個傢伙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.47,1:13:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.48,1:13:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,銀角
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.40,1:13:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做什……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.17,1:13:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個把戲……
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.58,1:13:35.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不會上當的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:37.10,1:13:39.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乖乖地把唐三藏交出來吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.98,1:13:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.87,1:13:51.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼樣，認輸了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.95,1:13:54.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,技安夠了，放過他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.42,1:13:56.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.56,1:13:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們敵不過他們的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.93,1:14:03.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們可不可以商量一下呢,銀角
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.59,1:14:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,商量什麼？
Dialogue: 0,1:14:13.86,1:14:15.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我啊\n技安
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.23,1:14:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要緊吧，技安
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.71,1:14:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回收成功
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.79,1:14:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真不愧是哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.41,1:14:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哆啦A夢真聰明
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.02,1:14:38.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就說你怎麼變了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.10,1:14:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,動腦筋的地方就包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.69,1:14:43.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過又收服了一個真是太令人高興了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.01,1:14:44.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊，宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.68,1:14:45.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.14,1:14:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.71,1:14:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼回事呢 宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.76,1:14:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，奇怪了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.99,1:14:54.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜不見了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.02,1:14:55.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跑哪去了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.31,1:14:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不見了\n宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.94,1:15:01.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜……
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.73,1:15:06.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她一定在我們不注意的時候被抓走了\n快去找她
Dialogue: 0,1:15:07.11,1:15:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道往哪個方向去了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.84,1:15:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能是那邊吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.49,1:15:14.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，我們去看看吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.06,1:15:14.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.72,1:15:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們慢吞吞地在做什麼\n通通給我退下
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.20,1:15:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.50,1:16:00.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.42,1:16:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.73,1:16:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是你啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.43,1:16:25.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎麼一個人呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.96,1:16:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師呢
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.78,1:16:29.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個……
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.76,1:16:31.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.59,1:16:33.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.93,1:16:35.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師被妖怪抓走了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.63,1:16:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很對不起
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.39,1:16:41.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是說過一切沒問題的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.77,1:16:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是大雄嗎\n真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.26,1:16:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.72,1:16:51.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.26,1:16:56.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂~
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.37,1:17:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，事情不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.71,1:17:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜也被抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.40,1:17:05.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼，三藏法師也被抓了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.12,1:17:07.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是因為你動作慢才會這樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.32,1:17:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是誰叫我先去探查敵情的
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.28,1:17:13.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道你就不能早點回來嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.18,1:17:15.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，這都你害的啦
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.05,1:17:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，不要再吵了先把他們救出來再說吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.47,1:17:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就是火焰山\n妖怪們好像都住在裏面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.00,1:17:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然這裏的火焰很大不過感覺倒不是那麼熱
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.90,1:17:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定有一般以上的火焰是假像
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.89,1:17:47.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜和三藏法師一定都被抓到裏面去了
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.06,1:17:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有可怕的牛魔王也在裏面
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.23,1:17:55.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是妖怪裏的大魔王嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.05,1:17:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.22,1:18:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要能打敗他的話其他妖怪的法力就會消失了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.96,1:18:03.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我們要怎麼樣才能抓到他呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.52,1:18:06.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之，我們先進去那裏再計畫吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.75,1:18:09.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我們有鐵扇公主的芭蕉扇的話
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.07,1:18:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就可以輕易把這些火焰煽滅了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.88,1:18:14.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有沒有什麼好法子啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.15,1:18:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我們繼續待在這裏的話
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.53,1:18:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他們兩個人一定會被妖怪吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.66,1:18:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，就試試那個吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:19.86,1:18:23.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,『雲雨製造機』
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.36,1:18:27.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像靠不住的樣子
Dialogue: 0,1:18:27.22,1:18:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,東西是要試過了才知道\n沒試過你怎麼知道靠不住呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.24,1:18:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.50,1:18:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了，繼續下雨吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.60,1:18:48.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是火焰一點也沒有減少的跡象
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.38,1:18:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失敗了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.55,1:18:58.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那根本就不是普通的火焰啊
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.27,1:19:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位……
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.08,1:19:04.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裏好像有入口
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.80,1:19:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪里啊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.90,1:19:08.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在那塊石頭的右邊
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.33,1:19:12.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:12.78,1:19:14.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\n我們就進去看看
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.75,1:19:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:26.40,1:19:28.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這一定就是入口沒有錯了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.54,1:19:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到這個地方會有入口
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.58,1:19:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個火焰很猛烈耶
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.42,1:19:34.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.08,1:19:37.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼辦
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.03,1:19:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣好了，我們直接闖進去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.89,1:19:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.51,1:19:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏面跟外面那些假像的火焰是不一樣的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.78,1:19:49.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,硬闖的話就一定會被抓住的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.99,1:19:51.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，請跟在我後面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.46,1:19:54.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.66,1:20:00.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趁他們沒有發現之前快一點
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.81,1:20:16.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,停下來
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.92,1:20:19.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踩到那個的話，後果可不堪設想
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.13,1:20:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們可要仔細看好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.80,1:20:26.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,後退
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.02,1:20:34.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這裏到處都有這種陷阱
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.85,1:20:40.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要碰到牆壁
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.21,1:20:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.28,1:20:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.84,1:20:59.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他對這裏面的情形為什麼會這麼清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.66,1:21:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，他居然會這麼清楚
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.50,1:21:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真令人懷疑啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.25,1:21:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這座城堡是建立在岩漿上面的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.32,1:21:36.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.27,1:21:51.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕\n小楊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.39,1:21:56.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我，不是我害你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.46,1:21:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做得很好，紅孩兒
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.59,1:22:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.45,1:22:10.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宜靜，宜靜
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.39,1:22:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們大家都平安無事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.39,1:22:14.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笨蛋，這哪叫平安無事啊
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.69,1:22:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你仔細看清楚吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.76,1:22:22.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小楊，你這個壞蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:22:22.63,1:22:26.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,處心積慮地居然連三藏法師也給騙了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.07,1:22:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.51,1:22:30.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我從一開始就知道了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.33,1:22:35.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算是妖怪只要是願意陪我走這段旅行的人
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.84,1:22:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不會拒絕他的因為他一定知道
Dialogue: 0,1:22:38.64,1:22:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我這段旅途的目的是什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.68,1:22:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太遺憾了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.43,1:22:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你永遠到達不了目的地的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.54,1:22:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點讓我吃了他們
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.73,1:22:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.20,1:22:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，馬上來了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.84,1:22:59.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點準備上菜
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.53,1:23:12.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽\n我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.44,1:23:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.31,1:23:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定把你做成牛肉飯的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.64,1:23:20.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先從那只肥胖的藍色狸貓開始吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:20.34,1:23:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是狸貓
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.31,1:23:26.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是機器人啊就算把我煮熟了\n也不好吃啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.28,1:23:27.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.08,1:23:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊\n小楊，你要幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.93,1:23:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.07,1:23:36.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點住手，牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.61,1:23:39.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觀世音菩薩
Dialogue: 0,1:23:42.85,1:23:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我來救你了，哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.90,1:23:47.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.37,1:23:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這時光機未免也太華麗了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.82,1:23:54.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這也沒有辦法啊\n我可花了好長的時間才找到你們的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:54.29,1:23:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你，哆啦美
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.30,1:23:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這小傢伙
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.36,1:23:58.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢打擾我用餐
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.95,1:24:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等，我來當你的對手
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.42,1:24:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，你什麼時候逃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.96,1:24:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦，原來你認識我啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.01,1:24:08.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:08.22,1:24:09.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一個人撐得住嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.31,1:24:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什麼時候跑掉的\n你們也快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.61,1:24:15.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,1:24:24.56,1:24:26.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.90,1:24:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出口在這邊，快點\n大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.19,1:24:35.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看我的厲害
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.00,1:24:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你要加油啊
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.76,1:24:45.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不會讓你們走出這裏的
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.61,1:24:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這個叛徒
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.47,1:24:48.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:24:48.52,1:24:50.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請你放過他們吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.11,1:24:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.51,1:24:56.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牛魔王
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.37,1:24:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿牛
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.19,1:25:02.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法了！大雄，振作一點
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.59,1:25:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點逃出這裏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.79,1:25:13.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放開我……
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.10,1:25:19.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟空，你受死吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.18,1:25:21.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如意棒變大吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:31.05,1:25:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老公
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.88,1:25:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.89,1:25:49.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄你打敗牛魔王了\n這樣一來，所有的妖怪都會失去法力
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.07,1:25:50.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.41,1:25:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好厲害喔，大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.00,1:25:54.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們快出去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.89,1:25:59.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快一點，火山要爆發了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.14,1:26:04.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快點往外逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.37,1:26:12.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們應該是來不及了現在該怎麼辦才好
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.61,1:26:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥你冷靜一點嘛你不是有任意門嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:26:17.15,1:26:18.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.32,1:26:20.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我差點忘了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.47,1:26:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.38,1:27:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二一……
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.65,1:27:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣火山就不會繼續延燒下去了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.97,1:27:20.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,終於結束了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.15,1:27:29.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過三藏法師的旅行還是要繼續走下去的\n而且還要好多年呢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.91,1:27:32.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.52,1:27:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都是我給大家帶來這麼多麻煩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.60,1:27:36.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要這麼說
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.56,1:27:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實一開始都是我的疏忽造成的
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.54,1:27:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，哥哥
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.97,1:27:44.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三藏法師\n都是我給您帶來這些麻煩
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.59,1:27:47.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要這麼說，我從來這裏面也學到了許多事
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.75,1:27:49.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.11,1:27:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以後就請把小楊交給我吧
Dialogue: 0,1:27:52.95,1:27:54.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.39,1:27:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是啊，哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.46,1:27:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很對不起一直不斷給你添這麼多麻煩
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.31,1:28:02.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要加油喔，小楊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.55,1:28:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你，孫悟空大人
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.37,1:28:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實我真正的名字是……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.28,1:28:10.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是孫悟空啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.35,1:28:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，我就是齊天大聖孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.42,1:28:15.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你的，孫悟空
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.94,1:28:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.88,1:28:28.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加油喔
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.22,1:28:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再見……
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.80,1:28:30.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也回去吧
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.72,1:28:31.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.32,1:28:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們的世界真的變回原來的樣子了嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.91,1:28:36.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心啦
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.71,1:28:41.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽，我回來了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.67,1:28:45.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這麼晚你到底跑到哪里去了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.31,1:28:47.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難道沒恢復原狀
Dialogue: 0,1:28:50.43,1:28:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.82,1:28:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們大家怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.38,1:29:00.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有角
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.84,1:29:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.93,1:29:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了，大雄\n媽媽……
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.77,1:29:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,媽媽
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.54,1:29:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼睛說 想對遠方 燃燒著的晚霞說話
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.05,1:29:27.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的嘴唇說 想對 陌生人說話
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.41,1:29:34.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的腳說 想追上 流逝的雲
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.72,1:29:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 去旅行 去旅行
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.37,1:29:47.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的鞋說 想走地圖上沒有的道路
Dialogue: 0,1:29:47.62,1:29:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手指說 想摘下 美麗的花朵
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.01,1:30:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以名為 明天的城市 作為目標
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.25,1:30:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Go to the west
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.47,1:30:21.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以名為 明天的城市 作為目標
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.46,1:30:49.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中國四千年歷史之謎
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.16,1:30:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們即將全力以赴解開這個謎
Dialogue: 0,1:30:52.83,1:30:54.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西遊記
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.19,1:30:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.35,1:31:00.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西遊記
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.75,1:31:04.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的有玄奘法師這個人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.68,1:31:09.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空很可能就是大雄你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.80,1:31:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太棒了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.28,1:31:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是大雄！跟真的大雄長得一模一樣
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.60,1:31:23.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他什麼時候變得這麼厲害了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.94,1:31:28.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢\n大雄的平行西遊記
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.86,1:31:30.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了……是蝙蝠
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.45,1:31:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孫悟空？你又說謊了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.38,1:31:37.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.87,1:31:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定就是真正的孫悟空了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.50,1:31:42.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗨~
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.93,1:31:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了解救受妖怪們統治的世界我們決定挺身而出
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.61,1:31:49.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哆啦A夢
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.81,1:31:52.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大雄的平行西遊記
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.85,1:31:55.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會在電影院等你們的
